@startuml CryptoWeb-E3-layered-wallettrading
title CryptoWeb - Wallet and Market Trade Settlement (LAYERED view)

!theme plain
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 75
skinparam ranksep 90
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
hide circle


package "Server_3 API coordination" {
  class "Trade Controller" as STC <<controller module>> {
    +posttrade()
    +gettrades()
  }
  class "Core Gateway" as GT <<HTTP gateway module>> {
    +executeUserTrade()
    +getFillByReferenceInternal()
  }
  class "Trade projection" as MT <<Mongoose model>> {
    +userId
    +referenceId
    +fillId
    +walletTxId
    +price
    +orderId
  }
}

package "Core trade and wallet services" {
  class "Trade Controller" as CTC <<controller module>> {
    +execute()
    +buy()
    +sell()
  }
  class "Trade Service" as CTS <<service module>> {
    +buy()
    +sell()
    +getFillByReference()
  }
  class "Binance Price Service" as PS <<service module>> {
    +getSpotPrice()
  }
  class "Wallet Controller" as WC <<controller module>> {
    +balance()
    +deposit()
    +withdraw()
  }
  class "Wallet Service" as WS <<service module>> {
    +getWallet()
    +depositAtomic()
    +withdrawAtomic()
  }
}

package "MySQL records" {
  class "wallets" as W <<SQL table>> {
    +id
    +user_id
    +balance
    +status
  }
  class "wallet_transactions" as TX <<SQL table>> {
    +id
    +user_id
    +status
    +amount
  }
  class "portfolio_holdings" as H <<SQL table>> {
    +id
    +user_id
    +symbol
    +quantity
  }
  class "trade_fills" as F <<SQL table>> {
    +id
    +user_id
    +wallet_tx_id
    +status
  }
}

STC ..> GT : REST client
STC ..> MT : upsert projection
GT ..> CTC : Core REST
CTC ..> PS : market price
CTC ..> CTS : executes
CTS ..> W : atomic SQL
CTS ..> TX : inserts
CTS ..> H : updates
CTS ..> F : inserts
WC ..> WS
WS ..> W
WS ..> TX

legend bottom
Core settlement is authoritative. Server_3 stores a secondary MongoDB Trade projection.
endlegend

@enduml
